This case is to configure kdump sysconfig (/etc/sysconfig/kdump)

Accepted Parameters:
 - KEY:
   The key of value to be updated in kdump sysconfig. E.g KDUMP_KERNELVER

 - ACTION:
   Action will be performed on the sysconfig.
   Valid values: remove/add/replace/

 - VALUE1:
   Value will be added/removed/replaced in sysconfig

 - VALUE2:
   Only applicable when ACTION=replace
   The value will be used to replace VALUE1



